Case in point, video and computer games.

20
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:16,960
Each year, hundreds of millions of dedicated gamers drop

21
00:01:16,961 --> 00:01:21,360
upwards of $20 billion of cold, hard cash to feed what's become

22
00:01:21,361 --> 00:01:22,360
a national obsession.

23
