00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:21,560
change the direction of the ball after it left the racket.

82
00:04:21,660 --> 00:04:23,060
Down I go.

83
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:25,060
Now watch me fake him up.

84
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:27,360
Despite Ping Pong's limitations,

85
00:04:27,460 --> 00:04:31,760
Baer sensed in 1970 that he had a marketable game.

86
00:04:31,860 --> 00:04:37,080
He licensed his brown box to TV manufacturer Magnavox.

87
00:04:37,180 --> 00:04:39,680
Magnavox renamed it the Odyssey.

88
