91
00:04:46,221 --> 00:04:50,820
In September 1971, Magnavox tested the Odyssey in Burlingame,

92
00:04:50,821 --> 00:04:54,820
California. A young engineer named Nolan

93
00:04:54,821 --> 00:04:58,260
Bushnell, who designed one of the first arcade games, Computer

94
