The Odyssey really wasn't a game in a lot of ways.

105
00:05:34,401 --> 00:05:35,800
It wasn't a lot of strategy.

106
00:05:35,801 --> 00:05:37,340
There was no scoring, no sound.

107
00:05:37,341 --> 00:05:40,440
But the most important characteristic

108
00:05:40,441 --> 00:05:45,880
was the algorithm by which where the ball hit on the paddle,

109
00:05:45,881 --> 00:05:47,480
