110
00:05:47,481 --> 00:05:52,240
So it allowed a paddle to be an offensive weapon,

111
00:05:52,241 --> 00:05:53,680
rather than just blocking the ball.

112
00:05:56,440 --> 00:06:00,240
In 1972, priced just under $100,

113
