the Odyssey hit store shelves.

114
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:06,940
Priced at a quarter per game, Atari's Pong

115
00:06:06,941 --> 00:06:09,740
at a local tavern in Sunnyvale, California.

116
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:12,640
