169
00:09:45,601 --> 00:09:46,600
4.79.

170
00:09:46,601 --> 00:09:50,600
4.79.

171
00:09:50,700 --> 00:09:52,400
When you look at the calculator,

172
00:09:52,500 --> 00:09:56,240
it gave you incredible accuracy to the right of the decimal

173
00:09:56,340 --> 00:09:59,040
point that with a slide rule, you just can't get that.

174
00:09:59,140 --> 00:10:01,340
Although the microchip was integral in creating

175
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:04,760
handheld consumer electronics, it required another 70s

176
00:10:04,860 --> 00:10:07,960
