177
00:10:08,060 --> 00:10:14,500
display, the light-emitting diode, or LED.

178
00:10:14,501 --> 00:10:17,340
An LED is a semiconductor junction,

179
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:21,340
and you pump in voltage and current, basically,

180
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:24,240
and that excites electrons in the material.

181
00:10:24,340 --> 00:10:26,340
And then when the electrons drop back down

182
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:28,840
to their normal state, they emit a photon.

183
00:10:28,940 --> 00:10:32,060
The photon is light.

184
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:34,360
Combining microchips and LEDs not only

185
00:10:34,460 --> 00:10:36,460
created portable electronics for work,

186
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:41,000
