So that's not too good in a watch.

194
00:11:02,260 --> 00:11:04,960
LED watches didn't survive the 70s,

195
00:11:05,060 --> 00:11:07,960
but the technology they harnessed is alive and well,

196
00:11:08,060 --> 00:11:12,900
and lighting up a style of high-definition TVs known as DLP,

197
