733
00:41:50,800 --> 00:41:52,000
They were talking to grandma.

734
00:41:52,100 --> 00:41:55,840
I had my grandmother on a CB, you know?

735
00:41:55,841 --> 00:41:59,680
A CB radio operates like any other radio transmitter.

736
00:41:59,780 --> 00:42:03,380
It has 40 channels and broadcasts over a narrow bandwidth,

737
00:42:03,480 --> 00:42:07,380
between 24 and 27 megahertz.

738
00:42:07,480 --> 00:42:09,880
But unlike the transmitter of a radio station,

739
00:42:09,980 --> 00:42:12,560
which broadcasts from a tall antenna tower,

740
00:42:12,660 --> 00:42:16,100
a CB radio has a short antenna, typically measuring

741
00:42:16,200 --> 00:42:18,600
only 10 feet tall.

742
00:42:18,700 --> 00:42:21,600
This limits its broadcast range to about five miles.

743
00:42:25,840 --> 00:42:29,640
In 1974, when the interstate speed limit was lowered from 70

744
00:42:29,740 --> 00:42:32,680
