754
00:43:15,580 --> 00:43:20,880
This particular CB model was one of our early 23-channel CB radios

755
00:43:20,881 --> 00:43:24,320
and was targeted to the four-wheel driver.

756
00:43:24,321 --> 00:43:27,480
It would be common to find it in a Panto, Chevette, Gremlin,

757
00:43:27,481 --> 00:43:29,320
a car like that.

758
00:43:29,321 --> 00:43:35,560
Early 70s retail price on this was around $100.

759
00:43:35,561 --> 00:43:38,160
As with most fads, the CB phenomenon

760
00:43:38,161 --> 00:43:40,160
gradually bugged out.

761
00:43:40,161 --> 00:43:43,080
By the 1980s, four-wheelers swapped their CB radios

762
00:43:43,081 --> 00:43:46,080
